Modifications made by Atum (the complete diff is patches/atum-phone.patch,
SHA-256 d7b68182ed249fbc27b0993eedd7390c389ad844a121172727d34284b9247694):
- bindings/matrix-sdk-ffi/src/room/mod.rs: adds a cached, read-only
  Room.accountDataRaw(eventType:) accessor and an authenticated
  Room.fetch_global_account_data_raw(event_type) read of one global
  account-data event, exposed to Swift as fetchGlobalAccountDataRaw(eventType:).
  It exposes no token, URL, arbitrary HTTP surface or raw credential path.
- crates/matrix-sdk-ui/src/room_list_service/mod.rs: adds three exact,
  empty-key required-state types (io.atum.conversation, io.atum.app_bot.dm,
  io.atum.founder_chat).
- crates/matrix-sdk/src/error.rs: treats reverse-proxy HTTP 520-529 as transient
  so the send queue retries instead of wedging.
- crates/matrix-sdk-ui/tests/integration/room_list_service.rs and
  crates/matrix-sdk/tests/integration/send_queue.rs: tests for the above.
The files under Sources/MatrixRustSDK are generated by UniFFI from the modified
source. The binary MatrixSDKFFI.xcframework is attached to each GitHub release.
